#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:5
msgid "Bind master item"
msgstr "捆绑主项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:7
msgid ""
"It can happen that one device should be represented in the `project`_ using "
"different `elements`_, power and control subsystem and auxiliary subsystems."
" All these `elements`_ should be considered as one device. QElectroTech "
"works with `master`_ and `slave`_ elements which are linked using `cross "
"references`_ to represent the device."
msgstr ""
"可能发生的情况是，一个设备应该使用不同的 `项目 <project_>`_，功率和控制子系统和辅助子系统在 `元件 <elements_>`_ "
"中被表示，所有这些 `元件 <elements_>`_ 都应被视为一个设备。QElectroTech与 `master <master_>`_ 和 "
"`slave <slave_>`_ 元素一起工作，这些元素是用 `交叉引用 <cross references_>`_ 连接来表示设备的。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:12
msgid ""
"A `master element`_ can be linked to a `slave element`_ with the following "
"steps:"
msgstr "A`主元件 <master element_>`_ 可以与 `奴隶元件 <slave element_>`_ 链接，步骤如下：1."

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select the `Slave element`_ which should be linked from the `project "
"collection`_ or from the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 `奴隶元素 <Slave element_>`_，该元素应当与 `元件集合 <project collection_>`_ 或 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 链接。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:15
msgid ""
"Right click on the selected `element`_ and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键点击选中的 `元件 <element_>`_ 并选择选项 **编辑元素** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Display`_ the **Cross-reference (Slave)** tab from the element editor PopUP"
" window"
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 元素编辑器 PopUP 窗口的 **Cross- reference (Slave)** 标签"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cross reference tab element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 交叉引用标签元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:29
msgid ""
"Search and select the desired `master element`_ from the available master "
"elements table."
msgstr "搜索并从可用的主元件表格中选择想要的 `主元件 <master element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:30
msgid ""
"Right click on the `master element`_ and select the option **Link the item**"
" to link the `master element`_ to the `slave element`_."
msgstr ""
"右键点击 `master 元素 <master element_>`_ 并选择选项 **链接项** 链接 `master 元素 <master "
"element_>`_ 与 `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_bind.rst:37
msgid "Press  **Apply** to accept and save the changes."
msgstr "按 **Apply** 接受并保存更改。"
